  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"188\" data-start=\"159\"><strong data-end=\"186\" data-start=\"163\">Brand Introduction:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"477\" data-start=\"189\"><strong data-end=\"206\" data-start=\"189\">flooring.zone</strong> is the <strong data-end=\"243\" data-start=\"214\">official webshop for kymo</strong> &ndash; a brand known for <strong data-end=\"299\" data-start=\"264\">high-end, design-driven carpets</strong>. As an <strong data-end=\"336\" data-start=\"307\">exclusive online platform</strong>, we offer a curated selection of <strong data-end=\"403\" data-start=\"370\">premium rugs</strong>, making kymo&rsquo;s signature craftsmanship accessible to a global audience.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"509\" data-start=\"479\"><strong data-end=\"507\" data-start=\"483\">Product Description:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"862\" data-start=\"510\">Our collection includes <strong data-end=\"571\" data-start=\"534\">handcrafted rugs</strong>, designed for <strong data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"586\">residential, hospitality, and commercial interiors</strong>. Customers can choose from <strong data-end=\"715\" data-start=\"668\">custom sizes, colors, and premium materials</strong> such as <strong data-end=\"763\" data-start=\"724\">wool, polysilk, and blended fibers</strong>. Every piece embodies <strong data-end=\"823\" data-start=\"786\">kymo&rsquo;s renowned design philosophy</strong>, combining aesthetics with durability.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"901\" data-start=\"864\"><strong data-end=\"899\" data-start=\"868\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"902\">\r\n<li data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"902\"><strong data-end=\"956\" data-start=\"904\">The only official online store for kymo products</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"960\"><strong data-end=\"987\" data-start=\"962\">Tailor-made solutions</strong> &ndash; customizable in <strong data-end=\"1032\" data-start=\"1006\">size, shape, and color</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1142\" data-start=\"1036\"><strong data-end=\"1063\" data-start=\"1038\">Premium craftsmanship</strong> &ndash; designed for <strong data-end=\"1139\" data-start=\"1079\">architects, interior designers, and discerning customers</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1234\" data-start=\"1143\"><strong data-end=\"1185\" data-start=\"1145\">Sustainable &amp; high-quality materials</strong> &ndash; made for long-lasting style and performance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1260\" data-start=\"1236\"><strong data-end=\"1258\" data-start=\"1240\">Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1529\" data-start=\"1261\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1366\" data-start=\"1261\"><strong data-end=\"1289\" data-start=\"1263\">Commission-based model</strong> &ndash; partners earn a <strong data-end=\"1334\" data-start=\"1308\">10% commission</strong> for each successful referral.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1456\" data-start=\"1367\"><strong data-end=\"1388\" data-start=\"1369\">Monthly payouts</strong> &ndash; via <strong data-end=\"1422\" data-start=\"1395\">bank transfer or PayPal</strong> at the beginning of each month.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1529\" data-start=\"1457\"><strong data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1459\">No upfront investment</strong> &ndash; partners can promote products risk-free.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1559\" data-start=\"1531\"><strong data-end=\"1557\" data-start=\"1535\">Other Information:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1560\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1656\" data-start=\"1560\"><strong data-end=\"1592\" data-start=\"1562\">Exclusive B2B partnerships</strong> &ndash; ideal for <strong data-end=\"1653\" data-start=\"1605\">architects, designers, and premium retailers</strong>.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1725\" data-start=\"1657\"><strong data-end=\"1689\" data-start=\"1659\">Material samples available</strong> &ndash; for professional presentations.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1799\" data-start=\"1726\"><strong data-end=\"1750\" data-start=\"1728\">Worldwide shipping</strong> &ndash; making high-end carpets accessible globally.</li>\r\n</ul>",
